        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967360/extras/d917caa4ff41293f2c4409a9c6c18504.avif?t=1757553618\" width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High speed &amp; hard crash &amp; eye-rolling Visual Bliss Violence at its finest here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first installment of the new indie game Lebevel weaves together is now available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy everything in sight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first in a series of new indie game levees!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967360/extras/b331e7f50eb3fd5ba1d10de23aaae2ad.avif?t=1757553618\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant Motion</strong>: Your character is always moving! Control momentum and speed as you smash through everything in your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong>: Navigate using the mouse, and perform a charged dash with the spacebar to surge forward and destroy even more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-Limited Challenge</strong>: How much damage can you cause within the time limit? Quick thinking and fast reactions are key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Target Score</strong>: Each stage has a set damage goal—can you reach it?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Events</strong>: Random events and challenges may appear during gameplay. Participation is optional, but successfully completing them can earn extra points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stages</strong>: There are 4 stages in total, each filled with destructible objects so you can enjoy a variety of destruction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smash through the city, rack up damage, and gradually spiral into ruin—an action game that explores the stages of life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Video Streaming Guidelines</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and organizations are permitted to upload and stream videos, regardless of monetization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We assume no responsibility for any damages arising from the uploading or streaming of such videos.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967360/extras/d917caa4ff41293f2c4409a9c6c18504.avif?t=1757553618\" width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High speed &amp; hard crash &amp; eye-rolling Visual Bliss Violence at its finest here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first installment of the new indie game Lebevel weaves together is now available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy everything in sight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first in a series of new indie game levees!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967360/extras/b331e7f50eb3fd5ba1d10de23aaae2ad.avif?t=1757553618\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant Motion</strong>: Your character is always moving! Control momentum and speed as you smash through everything in your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong>: Navigate using the mouse, and perform a charged dash with the spacebar to surge forward and destroy even more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-Limited Challenge</strong>: How much damage can you cause within the time limit? Quick thinking and fast reactions are key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Target Score</strong>: Each stage has a set damage goal—can you reach it?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Events</strong>: Random events and challenges may appear during gameplay. Participation is optional, but successfully completing them can earn extra points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stages</strong>: There are 4 stages in total, each filled with destructible objects so you can enjoy a variety of destruction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smash through the city, rack up damage, and gradually spiral into ruin—an action game that explores the stages of life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Video Streaming Guidelines</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and organizations are permitted to upload and stream videos, regardless of monetization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We assume no responsibility for any damages arising from the uploading or streaming of such videos.</p></li></ul>",
